  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "每张收集卡都代表旅途中的关键行动，构筑重点是安排动作并创造连续协同。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Each collected card represents a crucial action. Build the perfect deck, strategize your moves, and create powerful synergies as you progress.",
