      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "忠诚盟友各自携带专属牌组，加入后会直接改写战斗中的牌组互动。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Gather loyal allies, each with their own special deck, and take the dynamics of combat to a whole new level.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2087460/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "年轻教士Ruff必须对抗暴君红龙Zamir，从其压迫下解放王国并面对自身命运。",
      "dimension": "故事",
      "excerpt": "Get ready to embark on an epic and challenging journey, where you will become Ruff Ghanor, the young cleric destined to confront the tyrant Red Dragon, Zamir, and free the kingdom from his relentless oppression.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2087460/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
